+### Configuring push notifications
+
+To send web push notifications to phones and desktops, add a VAPID key pair as secrets. Generate one with:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=#{key.public_key}", "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=#{key.private_key}"'
+```
+
+Add both values to `.kamal/secrets`, and list `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` and `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` under `env/secret` in `config/deploy.yml`.
+Keep the pair stable: browsers bind their subscriptions to the public key, so changing it means everyone has to turn push notifications on again.
